      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Owasso%2C_Oklahoma",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1972, Owasso was chartered as a city, nearly twenty years after Oklahoma achieved statehood.",
